Data Licenses
-------------

The datasets used in this project are sourced from U.S. federal government
agencies and are in the public domain under 17 U.S.C. § 105:

- FBI Uniform Crime Reporting (UCR) Program data:
  Public domain. Source: https://cde.ucr.cjis.gov/LATEST/webapp/#/pages/downloads

- USDA Economic Research Service (ERS) Poverty Estimates:
  Public domain. Source: https://ers.usda.gov/data-products/county-level-data-sets

- USDA Economic Research Service (ERS) Unemployment and Median Household Income:
  Public domain. Source: https://ers.usda.gov/data-products/county-level-data-sets
